Port the pinned RK915 source to Linux 7.2.6.

Use the public wakeup-source allocator and release it only after users stop,
including HAL initialization failures. Keep syscore state separate from ops.
Retain single-radio mac80211 behavior, timer cancellation semantics, and
fixed-width RF parameter bytes (not NUL-terminated strings).

